  "body": "The spec was discussed in https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3236.\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chrome\n   * Firefox is happy to put this into the specification, with the caveat that they may want to push for removing the allow-downloads flag later (in favor of just always blocking downloads): https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/4293#issuecomment-594568779\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * [wpt commit](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/commit/22d4bec70c4dc2572fce851a8cea3c0d5c7f5489)\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/master/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chrome: [bug](https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=539938)\n   * Firefox: [bug](https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1558394)\n   * Safari: [bug](https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=198745)\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4293/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 4, 2020, 6:03 PM UTC (39b4d98)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4293/d22075c...39b4d98/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 4, 2020, 6:03 PM UTC (39b4d98)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4293/iframe-embed-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 4, 2020, 6:03 PM UTC (39b4d98)\">/iframe-embed-object.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4293/d22075c...39b4d98/iframe-embed-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 4, 2020, 6:03 PM UTC (39b4d98)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4293/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 4, 2020, 6:03 PM UTC (39b4d98)\">/links.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4293/d22075c...39b4d98/links.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 4, 2020, 6:03 PM UTC (39b4d98)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4293/origin.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 4, 2020, 6:03 PM UTC (39b4d98)\">/origin.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4293/d22075c...39b4d98/origin.html\" title=\"Last updated on Mar 4, 2020, 6:03 PM UTC (39b4d98)\">diff</a> )",
